  "description": "Utility library for C# — a collection of pure functions, extension methods and types\n            to cover everyday development needs without pulling in external dependencies.\n            Includes async helpers (Retry, Sleep, SetTimeout/ClearTimeout, WithTimeout),\n            functional utilities (Debounce, Throttle, Memoize, Once, Pipe), collection extensions\n            (Chunk, Flatten, Partition, Zip...), dictionary helpers (Pick, Omit, DeepMerge...),\n            string validators, precompiled regexes and a few handy types (ClampedValue, JsObject, Random).\n            On .NET 8+, also provides safe unsigned integers (RByte, RUshort, RUint, RUlong, RUint128,\n            RNuint) that throw on overflow instead of wrapping, with generic math support.\n            Targets netstandard2.0, netstandard2.1, net8, net9 and net10.",
